(REQUEST FOR PROPOSAL) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Solicitation No.: DHS-2025-ICT-0042) Tj T*
(Issued by: U.S. Department of Homeland Security) Tj T*
(Office of the Chief Information Officer) Tj T*
(Issue Date: March 1, 2025) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PROJECT TITLE: Enterprise Cloud Security Operations Platform) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. INTRODUCTION) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The Department of Homeland Security \(DHS\), Office of the Chief Information Officer) Tj T*
(\(OCIO\), is soliciting proposals from qualified vendors to design, implement, and) Tj T*
(operate an Enterprise Cloud Security Operations Platform \(ECSOP\). The platform) Tj T*
(must provide continuous monitoring, threat detection, and incident response) Tj T*
(capabilities across DHS cloud environments \(AWS GovCloud, Azure Government, and) Tj T*
(on-premises hybrid infrastructure\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. SCOPE OF WORK) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The contractor shall:) Tj T*
(- Design and deploy a Security Information and Event Management \(SIEM\) system) Tj T*
(  capable of ingesting 500,000+ events per second) Tj T*
(- Implement a Security Orchestration, Automation, and Response \(SOAR\) platform) Tj T*
(- Provide 24x7x365 Security Operations Center \(SOC\) staffing with cleared personnel) Tj T*
(- Develop and maintain 200+ detection rules aligned to MITRE ATT&CK framework) Tj T*
(- Deliver monthly threat intelligence reports and quarterly security posture assessments) Tj T*
(- Integrate with existing DHS identity management and ticketing systems) Tj T*
(- Conduct quarterly red team exercises and penetration testing) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. MANDATORY REQUIREMENTS) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(- Contractor must hold a current FedRAMP High authorization or equivalent) Tj T*
(- All personnel must hold active Secret clearance \(TS/SCI required for senior roles\)) Tj T*
(- Platform must achieve 99.99% uptime SLA) Tj T*
(- All data must remain within FedRAMP-authorized U.S.-based data centers) Tj T*
(- Contractor must comply with NIST SP 800-53 Rev 5 and DHS 4300A) Tj T*
(- Zero-trust architecture implementation required) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
