(4. PREFERRED QUALIFICATIONS) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(- Prior DHS or IC agency contract experience) Tj T*
(- CMMC Level 2 or higher certification) Tj T*
(- Existing integrations with Splunk, Microsoft Sentinel, or Palo Alto Cortex XSOAR) Tj T*
(- ISO 27001 and SOC 2 Type II certifications) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. EVALUATION CRITERIA) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Proposals will be evaluated on the following factors \(listed in order of importance\):) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Technical Approach and Security Architecture       - 35%) Tj T*
(2. Management Approach and Staffing Plan              - 25%) Tj T*
(3. Price / Total Cost of Ownership \(5-year\)           - 25%) Tj T*
(4. Past Performance \(minimum 3 relevant references\)   - 15%) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6. CONTRACT DETAILS) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Contract Type: Firm Fixed Price \(FFP\) with award fee provisions) Tj T*
(Estimated Value: $47,500,000 \(over base + option periods\)) Tj T*
(Base Period: 12 months from Notice to Proceed) Tj T*
(Option Periods: Four \(4\) one-year options) Tj T*
(Place of Performance: Washington, D.C. Metro area; remote work permitted up to 40%) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(7. SET-ASIDE) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(This acquisition is set aside 100% for Small Business concerns under) Tj T*
(NAICS code 541519 \(Other Computer Related Services\), size standard $34M.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(8. KEY DATES) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(- RFP Release:                    March 1, 2025) Tj T*
(- Industry Day / Bidder Q&A:      March 14, 2025 at 10:00 AM ET \(virtual\)) Tj T*
(- Questions Deadline:             March 21, 2025 at 5:00 PM ET) Tj T*
(- Government Responses to Q&A:   April 4, 2025) Tj T*
(- Proposal Due Date:              April 25, 2025 at 2:00 PM ET) Tj T*
(- Anticipated Award:              June 15, 2025) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(9. SUBMISSION REQUIREMENTS) Tj T*
ET
endstream
