(Proposals must include:) Tj T*
(- Volume I: Technical Approach \(max 40 pages\)) Tj T*
(- Volume II: Management Approach and Staffing Plan \(max 20 pages\)) Tj T*
(- Volume III: Past Performance \(max 5 pages per reference, minimum 3\)) Tj T*
(- Volume IV: Price/Cost \(no page limit; use provided Price Template\)) Tj T*
(- Signed representations and certifications \(SAM.gov current registration required\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(10. SUBMISSION INSTRUCTIONS) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Submit proposals electronically via the DHS eSRS portal by the deadline above.) Tj T*
(Hard copy submissions will NOT be accepted. Late proposals will not be considered.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
