() Tj T*
(12. ATTACHMENTS) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Attachment A: Statement of Work \(SOW\) - Full Detail) Tj T*
(Attachment B: Price/Cost Template \(Excel\)) Tj T*
(Attachment C: DHS Security Requirements Guide) Tj T*
(Attachment D: Sample Contract Clauses) Tj T*
(Attachment E: System Architecture Overview \(For Reference Only\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(13. RED FLAGS / SPECIAL CLAUSES) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(NOTE: The Government reserves the right to award without discussions.) Tj T*
(Offerors are cautioned that the Government may make award based on initial) Tj T*
(proposals; therefore, offerors should submit their best offer initially.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(All awardees will be subject to a 30-day transition-in period with no) Tj T*
(additional compensation. Failure to achieve full operational capability) Tj T*
(within 30 days may result in contract termination for default.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
